      "claim": "Criterion 1's witness is the first test in tests/test_session.py to import and drive saffron.cli: no existing test there imports cli, and the recipe calls cli.main and monkeypatches saffron.cli.run_gh and saffron.cli.package_phase.real_remote, adding a new cross-module dependency to that file. This looks like the only workable placement rather than a flaw, since the two REBUT sub-cases need session-level harness (_rebuttable, _through_rebut) that exists only in tests/test_session.py, and the obvious alternative homes, tests/test_cli.py and tests/test_reconcile.py, are both forbidden.",
